archive root has **57** tracked entries, inventory\n65\t`52ac3b835b45e6aa3c54ea72f57180421822c5719d2a9e9bca0d2abbbf0a0721`.\n66\tThese current git-tree counts are **not** the historical 59-file runtime\n67\tfilesystem inventory. No old 59/57 archive or inventory is rewritten or treated\n68\tas freshly authenticated native evidence. All ten referenced frozen/prior source\n69\thashes match the locked JSON; their exact paths and hashes are in `proposal.json`.\n70\t\n71\t## One selected solution: only checkout-step runtime Git configuration\n72\t\n73\tAdd exactly four lines to the existing checkout step:\n74\t\n75\t```diff\n76\t       - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n77\t+        env:\n78\t+          GIT_CONFIG_COUNT: '1'\n79\t+          GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0: core.longpaths\n80\t+          GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0: 'true'"}
